    <string name="aide_proprietaire">PrP must become the device owner. This is done once from a PC with tools/installer-android.bat (USB debugging on, accounts removed during the operation). Afterwards you can add your accounts back.</string>
    <string name="aide_garde">The guard reads browser addresses to block adult sites. Turn it on with the button below.</string>
    <string name="aide_reactivation">To restart its guard by itself, PrP needs a permission granted once from the PC (install script).</string>
    <string name="aide_dns">The family DNS filters adult sites across the whole phone. It is applied when you lock.</string>
    <string name="aide_reglages">Factory reset, safe mode, adding users and changing DNS are blocked when you lock, so PrP cannot be bypassed.</string>
    <string name="aide_modele">The detection model loads when the guard starts. If it stays red, open “Details” in the Image detection card.</string>
    <string name="dns_degrade">The family DNS resolvers are unreachable on this network: PrP left DNS on automatic so as not to cut the Internet, and retries every minute.</string>
    <string name="activer_garde">Turn on the guard</string>
